cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code and data for: From directional sensing to task completion: mapping the operating envelope of wind-aware quadrotor allocation and control
message: If you use this code or data, please cite this archive and the manuscript.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Zeyu
    family-names: Fu
    email: fuzeyu99@126.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0001-8329-0108'
    affiliation: 'Army Medical University, Chongqing, China'
abstract: >-
  Simulation logs, derived statistical tables, figure code and manuscript source for a 17-figure, 12-table study measuring the disturbance band in which a wind-aware allocation-and-control stack helps a four-quadrotor swarm, with estimate quality, temporal profiles, pathway sensitivity, scene geometry and homogeneous team-size transfer. Parent-child and air-ground handoff claims are outside scope.
keywords:
  - task allocation
  - quadrotor swarm
  - wind disturbance
  - effect size
  - thresholded endpoint
  - reproducibility
